                <pb facs="0353" n="265" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg265"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Powell to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Santo
                                Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-01-20"><hi rendition="#italic">January 20,
                        1904</hi></date>.<lb/>(Received 1.10 a.m., January 23,
                    1904.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Powell reports that the American legation has this day recognized the
                    provisional government under President Morales, and that the United States
                    consuls and naval vessels in port have been notified.)</p>
            </div>
